Now for verify_loading_profile_nominal, we also need loading_container_leg_linked (yes). And we need not destination_leg_loaded (true if we assembled origin_loaded_leg only). So that works.

Thus we can use assemble_origin_loaded_leg.

Now we need origin_leg_loaded for some steps? Not required for verify_loading_profile_nominal; but later maybe for clearance? establish_clearance_nominal requires not origin_leg_loaded and not destination_leg_loaded. That's not satisfied if we have origin_leg_loaded. So we need to use establish_clearance_nominal (which requires neither leg loaded). So we should avoid loading leg before clearance? Actually establish_clearance_nominal requires not origin_leg_loaded and not destination_leg_loaded. So we need to establish clearance before loading leg? But we need leg assembled to load container and to have loading_container_leg_linked. The loading_container_leg_linked is needed for loading verification and clearance? The establish_clearance_nominal requires loading_container_leg_linked (yes) and candidate_loading_verified, compliance linked, loading container linked, and not origin_leg_loaded, not destination_leg_loaded. So we need leg assembled but not loaded (i.e., assemble_transport_leg). That gives no leg loaded. So we should assemble_transport_leg (which requires origin and destination availability confirmed, nodes ready). That yields transport_leg_assembled, links, but no leg loaded.

Thus steps: assemble_transport_leg (no leg loaded). Then load_container_onto_leg (makes loading_container_loaded and loading_container_leg_linked). Then we have loading_container_leg_linked true, leg not loaded. Then we can stage candidate (requires loading_container_loaded, loading_container_leg_linked, candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, not origin_leg_loaded). Since leg not loaded, origin_leg_loaded false, good. Then verify_loading_profile_nominal (requires candidate_staged_for_loading, skill cert linked, operator linked, loading_container linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not destination_leg_loaded). Since leg not loaded, destination_leg_loaded false. Good.

