Thus each of the four candidates needs: create, allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm prepared, assign operator, activate node (origin or destination), lock availability (origin or destination). For schedule candidates we also need to load container, stage, verify loading, establish clearance, finalize direct, allocate dispatch slot, dispatch.

